---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { primitives, site } from '../consts';
---

<Section id="model" title="The model">
  <p>
    The ontology has six members, and each of them is a region of a coordinate space rather than a
    step in a sequence.
  </p>

  <dl class="defs">
    {
      primitives.map((item) => (
        <>
          <dt>{item.name}</dt>
          <dd>{item.body}</dd>
        </>
      ))
    }
  </dl>

  <p class="note">
    The scene above draws all six at once. The <a href={site.axioms}>axioms</a> state them
    formally, and the <a href={site.whitepaperHtml}>whitepaper</a> derives the stack from them.
  </p>
</Section>

<style>
  .note {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }
</style>
